    <strong>Aptitude and psychometric tests can give hints about reasoning, interests and preferences, but they cannot predict success or settle a choice, so use them as one input, check the source and quality, avoid paying for promises of certainty and confirm the hints with real tasks and conversations.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
